      "text": "Technical Leadership\n\nPlatform Architecture Initiative\n\nZalando SE    2023–Present\n\nSpeaking\n\n• Leading cross-team working group (12 engineers) defining platform standards for 250+ microservices\n\n• Designed service mesh strategy using Istio, reducing inter-service latency by 30%\n\n• Authored ADRs (Architecture Decision Records) adopted as standard across 6 engineering domains\n\nEngineering Excellence Program\n\nOpen Source                                Zalando SE   2022\n\n• Established inner-source program enabling engineers to contribute to shared platform libraries\n\n• Introduced weekly architecture guild (40+ members) raising the bar on system design\n\n• Reduced new-engineer onboarding time from 3 weeks to 5 days via coding standards docs\n\nPublications\n\nEvent-Driven Architectures in Practice\n\nZalando Engineering Blog   2023\n\nDeep dive on migrating checkout to event-driven microservices.\n\n45K+ reads.\n\nReal-Time Collaborative Editing with CRDTs\n\nThe Pragmatic Engineer   2023\n\nTutorial on operational transforms vs CRDTs for collaborative apps.\n\n28K+ reads.\n\nReducing Cloud Costs Without Reducing Velocity\n\nInfoQ   2022\n\nCase study on EUR 180K/year savings through automated resource governance. 19K+ reads."
